<h2><%= h @owner %>/<%= h @name %></h2>

<p>Clone it:</p>
<pre>git clone <%= h clone_url(@owner, @name) %></pre>

<p>Push to it (you'll be asked for <%= h @owner %>'s password):</p>
<pre>git remote add origin <%= h clone_url(@owner, @name) %>
git push -u origin main</pre>

<p>On disk, this repository is a bare git repo at:</p>
<pre><%= h @path %></pre>

<p>Browsing files and commits arrives in step 3, and SSH access in step 4.</p>
